Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguuji!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.61,0:00:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to get crushed to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.25,0:00:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.13,0:00:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea I'd been\Ncausing you all this pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.69,0:00:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.49,0:00:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, in my entire life\NI've never once praised anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.89,0:00:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even now I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.19,0:00:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.35,0:00:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you might suck as a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.25,0:00:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Schwa, stay out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.45,0:00:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's cheating All of my\Ndirect attacks just get deflected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.53,0:00:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll knock off the arms if I punch again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.75,0:00:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
