Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.93,0:00:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.27,0:01:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those thoughts, I think maybe\Nit's true that I suck as a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, you're still stuck on\Nthat when we're about to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.87,0:01:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I help when I end up hurting\Npeople just by being around them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.71,0:01:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never considered that\Nwhat I thought was helpful
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.15,0:01:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,criticism could come off as\Njudgmental or patronizing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.41,0:01:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if someone mistook my intent,\Nof course they would be hurt by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.89,0:01:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jigun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.81,0:01:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jigunji, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.72,0:01:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for it to come from someone you\Nconsider to be your best friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.67,0:01:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone you believe is\Nbetter than you in every way?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.03,0:01:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's no wonder Tachibana\Nis in so much pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.23,0:01:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it would be best if\NI disappeared from his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.61,0:01:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't you listening to\Na single word he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.01,0:01:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He literally just told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.15,0:01:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing he takes pride in is\Nthe fact that you're his best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.47,0:01:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So even though he's completely\Nunhinged and trying to kill us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.47,0:01:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're still important to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.91,0:01:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard for people to admit\Nwhat they really care about,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.53,0:01:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially when they're in a bad place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.49,0:01:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Him opening up like this is a huge deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.71,0:02:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you were to walk out on him\Nnow after everything that's happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.55,0:02:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't be protecting him,\Nyou'd be hurting him all over again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.67,0:02:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ethan, what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.49,0:02:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been telling you what\Nto do this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.89,0:02:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants you to compliment\Nhim, so just do it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.53,0:02:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I did, but it\Njust made him angrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.07,0:02:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because what you told\Nhim didn't mean anything to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.59,0:02:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs to know how you\Nfeel from the bottom of your
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.63,0:02:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heart something that shows\Nhim how important he is to you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.69,0:02:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I don't get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.11,0:02:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.07,0:02:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.37,0:02:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This shouldn't be that hard for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.07,0:02:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.21,0:02:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it embarrassing to\Nconfess something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ARE YOU KIDDING ME?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what was that for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.65,0:02:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SHUT UP!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.15,0:02:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your bizarre lover's quarrel\Nis endangering a whole kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.21,0:02:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine how it feels for all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.93,0:02:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lover's quarrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.67,0:02:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a thirty-something-year-old man,\Nbut you've been acting like a whiny teen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.43,0:02:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You even got jealous because the princess\Nstarted hanging out with Tachibana!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.45,0:03:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already told you, I\Nwasn't jealous! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.29,0:03:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the problem right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't admit you're\Njealous or care about him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.71,0:03:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when it's a totally normal\Nguy-friend thing to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.87,0:03:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that means you felt that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.37,0:03:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.83,0:03:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.87,0:03:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When my friend Yamazato stopped hanging\Nout with me after he got a girlfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got stupid jealous, but I dealt\Nwith it like a normal person!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.17,0:03:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keeping Tachibana at arm's\Nlength because he's a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.17,0:03:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dude is weirder than\Nadmitting he's special to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.53,0:03:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you being self-conscious about the\Nwhole thing only adds to the weirdness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.81,0:03:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I finally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.57,0:03:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a child, I was taught\Nto never rely on others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.49,0:03:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who did were seen\Nas selfish or spoiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.37,0:03:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never falter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.93,0:03:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Carry yourself with dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.37,0:03:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be the example to society.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.85,0:04:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These ideas were drilled into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never appear as weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.83,0:04:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never show vulnerability.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was how I could become strong\Nenough to survive the world on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.21,0:04:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came to believe that if I were to bare\Nmy soul, I'd be risking myself for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.19,0:04:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.83,0:04:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys can be jealous over each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.89,0:04:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a completely normal thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.89,0:04:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You agree? What? Oh, yeah! Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.91,0:04:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do what you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.89,0:04:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.85,0:04:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.69,0:04:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's high time I let myself be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.17,0:04:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe that much to my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.39,0:04:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That and more, right, Schwartz? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.05,0:04:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One thousand percent!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've kept this paint\Nbottled up for so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.83,0:04:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The least you can do is\Nlet me take it out on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.73,0:05:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why try this hard to stop me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.19,0:05:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all I really want to do is\Nfeel a little better about myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.09,0:05:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always envied you, Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.25,0:05:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You make friends everywhere you go,\Nand no matter where you might be,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're always surrounded by smiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.31,0:05:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just being part of your life\Nis enough to warm my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.83,0:05:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earlier you said you were sick of\Nbeing a person who has nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.87,0:05:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you think that when your life\Nis filled with so much more than mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.21,0:05:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you could see what I see in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.01,0:05:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, after all your years together,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.49,0:05:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you still don't have a clue\Nabout how he truly feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.47,0:05:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you trust anything he says?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.73,0:05:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's never been truly honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.47,0:05:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how clever he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.87,0:05:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine how easy it would be for\Nhim to hide his true feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.39,0:05:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like how you were able to hide\Nyour jealousy of him all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.07,0:05:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.99,0:05:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet deep down you're just laughing\Nat how much of a loser I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.93,0:05:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The loser who's jealous\Nof his best friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:05:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who complains about how\Nunfair the world is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because he doesn't have\Nany special talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.97,0:06:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't matter what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.39,0:06:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never lasted long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.83,0:06:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most I ever do is moan about\Nall the things I failed at.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.27,0:06:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, you're out there\Nbeing perfect at everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The difference between us was clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've earned tons of\Nawards and certificates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.61,0:06:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a student council\Npresident and the student rep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.11,0:06:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're stupid popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.23,0:06:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never tolerated bullies or thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.93,0:06:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved those who\Ncouldn't save themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.51,0:06:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realized all of this the moment\Nwe met back in grade school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.35,0:06:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never talked at all, but\Nyou still stood up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.61,0:06:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even know your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.43,0:06:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.71,0:06:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I was jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.75,0:06:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this time, I wanted\Nto be just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.77,0:06:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.15,0:06:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leo, you look just like a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.87,0:07:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I look up to you!
