Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.83,0:07:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it sounds like Mepon is shutting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.85,0:07:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, does that touch Mehpon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.51,0:07:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.81,0:07:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like an error warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.95,0:07:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Error! Error!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.47,0:07:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unknown interference with\Nenergy source detected!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.07,0:07:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Initiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:07:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.90,0:08:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To Resos Mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.61,0:08:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commencing extermination of all life\Nforms in the immediate vicinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.17,0:08:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.67,0:08:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things just got worse!
