Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.95,0:08:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.51,0:08:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Riso's smoke sounds scary enough, but now\Nwe got literal targets on our foreheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.27,0:08:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's game over, man! Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.13,0:08:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.85,0:08:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our goals are still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.87,0:08:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, we're going to rescue Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.35,0:08:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After which, I'll destroy\NMepon before anyone is hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.67,0:08:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.97,0:08:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.89,0:08:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Schwartz!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try! Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.85,0:08:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Jinguuji! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.59,0:09:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all the things that crappy goddess\Nhas done, she outdid herself with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.53,0:09:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My best friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.67,0:09:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You alright, Tachibana?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.77,0:09:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look like you just got off a bender.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.61,0:09:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguuji?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.59,0:09:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let my guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.89,0:09:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot how dangerous\Nthose teary eyes can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:10:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, you must think I'm pathetic\Nacting like a bratty child at my age.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.91,0:10:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have gotten killed, and I\Nnearly destroyed the entire kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.53,0:10:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let myself get caught\Nup in a dumb rebellion
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and ended up going on a robot rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.23,0:10:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a garbage person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.39,0:10:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have every reason to hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I understand if you don't\Nwant me in your life anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana, I'm only\Ngoing to say this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.43,0:10:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that you're amazing\Nand you're a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.87,0:10:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're very considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.41,0:10:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never forget to follow up with people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.27,0:10:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always pay attention\Nand learn their needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.51,0:10:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what people might ask of\Nyou, you give it to them in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You make friends easily, which to\Nme is a sign of good character.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.59,0:10:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's something that\NI've never been able to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.79,0:10:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kind, and though bosses tend to\Nhate you, your juniors all love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.25,0:10:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have an upbeat attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.75,0:10:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your smile brightens my day,\Nand you're an expressive person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.97,0:11:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Animals love to be around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.41,0:11:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never get full of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.01,0:11:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You replace the toilet paper in\Nthe bathroom when the rolls out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.53,0:11:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're smarter than you give yourself\Ncredit for, and you are athletic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just think you're not because\Nyou compare yourself to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.51,0:11:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had dark times I couldn't\Nhave gotten through without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.33,0:11:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admire your empathy and your bizarre\Nability to get people to laugh at anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.41,0:11:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like your terrible jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.87,0:11:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're around, the world is brighter,\Nand that saved me from many a bad day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have the best ugly cry,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.69,0:11:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially when you watch videos of\Ncute animals or kids doing errands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.75,0:11:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when something is clearly staged,\Nyou can love it unapologetically.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like how you'll try\Npopular things just because.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.47,0:11:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after you found out I liked whiskey,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.41,0:11:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you always kept some on hand\Ndespite hating it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like how easy it is for\Nyou to praise someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.25,0:11:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if you don't think you deserve any.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.95,0:11:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when you see someone meet with\Nmisfortune, you always feel bad for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like that you cry for your friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.69,0:11:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but still go out of your way to understand\Nand respect people's boundaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.95,0:11:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are by far the most loyal and\Nempathetic person I have ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.59,0:11:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're oblivious to when others\Nhate you, so you don't reciprocate,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.23,0:12:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though that obliviousness\Ncan get you in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.25,0:12:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like that whenever you go out to eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.91,0:12:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you go out of your way to\Ntell the staff that they
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did a good job and how\Nmuch you enjoyed the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like how much fun you can have when you're\Nat cultural festivals or doing sports,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.87,0:12:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and how unexpectedly upset\Nyou can get when you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like that you think the unluckiest\Nfortune is actually lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.11,0:12:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Animals don't just like\Nyou, they're drawn to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.27,0:12:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like that you always share\Nvideos you think are funny,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.63,0:12:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and how you can't stand horror movies\Nbut force yourself through them anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.07,0:12:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like that somehow you never\Nhave a handkerchief on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.33,0:12:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you always make sure to have bandages.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.79,0:12:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your terrible taste in women and that\Nyou're weirdly childlike I like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.51,0:12:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll say it's a good day\Njust because the morning
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weather is nice and the way\Nyou like Hokkaido and Okinawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like that despite how much\Nyou complain about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.57,0:12:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You care for your family more\Nthan anything I like how much
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.93,0:12:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you love kids and your tendency\Nto spoil your younger sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like that no matter how upset\Nyou get you're over in a week that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you ask before squeezing lemon\Nover karage and that you can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.43,0:12:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm nervous and always know\Nexactly what to say to help me relax?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.13,0:12:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like that you always have fun when I\Ntake you shopping even if it's somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.31,0:12:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's not your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:13:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like that you unabashedly\Nsay the most embarrassing
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.49,0:13:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,things and how being around\Nme seems so effortless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.01,0:13:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like how you say everything\Nyou eat is delicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.37,0:13:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially since you\Ndon't like green peppers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.23,0:13:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like how you can't finish\Nyour sentences when you're
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.45,0:13:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,drunk or how you'll give\Nup your seat on a train.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.45,0:13:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like that you're so much better\Nat drawing than I am and how
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.77,0:13:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,diligent you are with properly\Nshaving your face each and every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like that you always make sure\Nto say thank you for this meal
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.29,0:13:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the way you make up your mind\Nwhen you commit to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.45,0:13:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So all in all, I would have\Nto say to me, on any scale,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.19,0:13:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you rate much higher than\Nthe Average person would
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.13,0:13:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you like me to keep going\Noh thank you what didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.25,0:13:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you tell me that you wanted\Nme to praise you more deal
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.45,0:13:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with it once i get started\Ni can't stop myself okay
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.31,0:13:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah all right that was too much why did
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.61,0:13:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have to go so far\Nfor so long it was nice
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.11,0:13:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for a while but you kept going and going\Nare you embarrassed of course i am you jerk
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why did you start\Nlaughing all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.77,0:14:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.11,0:14:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.89,0:14:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking, it's\Nnice to be honest with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right then, ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.15,0:14:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.83,0:14:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.79,0:14:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know he could laugh like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.81,0:14:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.67,0:14:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.83,0:14:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damage to critical system detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unit P-5-8, self-destruct\Nsequence initiated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.29,0:14:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.75,0:14:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm stealing some of your karaka, Hina.
