Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have some of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.01,0:15:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just for kidnapping and\Nendangering your daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.99,0:15:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but also for my part in helping her create
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.15,0:15:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a full-blown rebellion\Nagainst the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honored hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.51,0:15:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is I who should apologize\Nfor the actions of my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.07,0:15:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! It was me! It was all me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.03,0:15:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take any punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.59,0:15:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.21,0:15:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This all started with my daughter,\Nand she should be held responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.13,0:15:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have anything to apologize for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.61,0:15:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but half of this\Nwas directly your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.67,0:15:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hardly unusual for a human to\Nmake a mistake or two in their life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scary how easily you can look back on this\Nwhole nightmare and say, Oopsie daisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.33,0:15:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Iggy, you've grown up into\Nsuch an exceptional young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.25,0:15:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the king's happy, then\NI guess everything's fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.23,0:15:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, a simple answer to something\Nthis complicated might be best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.13,0:15:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that maid hadn't been\Npromoted or hired at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.23,0:16:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if Tachibana hadn't followed the princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or if Mouria had managed\Nto rescue either of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.19,0:16:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mistakes were made all around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.81,0:16:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So for clarity's sake, I say we\Nshould blame it on the head maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.87,0:16:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blame the head maid, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.25,0:16:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both she and Viz admitted they've\Nbeen working with the demon lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.41,0:16:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be surprised if\Nshe was behind everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.05,0:16:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well that wasn't according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.09,0:16:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we'd be able to\Ntake over this kingdom easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.57,0:16:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess I was wrong about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.23,0:16:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.41,0:16:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want the demon lord to find\Nmy head and make it all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.63,0:16:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it seems you and I have same idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.49,0:16:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For once let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.97,0:16:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never had I imagined that we would\Nbe attacked so directly like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.57,0:16:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as the goddess said this is no\Ntime for the kingdom to go to war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.21,0:16:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the more reason for\Nus to defeat the demon
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lord as quickly as possible\Nfor everyone's benefit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.05,0:16:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.73,0:16:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've only just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.09,0:17:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we should.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since the demon lord's\Nforces know we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.65,0:17:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd only cause more trouble if we stayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.63,0:17:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be best for everyone if\Nwe left as soon as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.21,0:17:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we'll head out tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.11,0:17:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.55,0:17:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally make a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.45,0:17:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to let her go so\Nquickly after we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.53,0:17:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.85,0:17:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of this as a chance\Nto make more friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got a great personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.91,0:17:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you could be friends\Nwith someone like me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.41,0:17:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll have no\Nproblem thinking more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.71,0:17:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana, please don't talk\Nabout yourself like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to lift others up\Nbut you shouldn't have to put
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.95,0:17:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yourself down you deserve to\Nbe treated with kindness and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.59,0:17:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,respect just like anyone else\Nbeing considerate of others
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.77,0:17:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't mean you shouldn't expect\Nthe same in return okay i get
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.17,0:17:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it i take it all back we need\Nto hurry up and defeat the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.05,0:17:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,demon lord so i can go back to\Nmy old self the sooner we're on
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.05,0:17:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the road the sooner that happens\Nisn't it weird that we've
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.35,0:18:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come this far and we still have\Nno idea how to find the demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.53,0:18:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.47,0:18:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tachibana, did you say you don't\Nknow how to find the Demon Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.59,0:18:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.63,0:18:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could tell you how to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know? I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.83,0:18:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, the goddess didn't tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the first thing mine\Nshowed me when I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.17,0:18:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that big white\Nspire on the horizon, right?
