Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.73,0:18:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.65,0:18:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you never told us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.97,0:18:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I mean, it never came up, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.87,0:18:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just assumed you already knew.\NShe said the castle was near.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the belly button so it's\Nprobably around here at least we.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.35,0:18:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have an idea where we\Nshould be going that we
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do it's been too long\Nsince i've been home sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.05,0:18:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pillow of mine oh how\Ni've missed you tachibana
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.87,0:18:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you sure you're okay\Nwith leaving tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.25,0:18:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's for the best isn't it plus now we\Nknow where we're supposed to go well after
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.83,0:18:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everything that's happened i thought you'd
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.99,0:19:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want to rest and there's\Nmore stuff about the.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.93,0:19:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Religion i wanted to look into\Nplus we have the tiara back
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.39,0:19:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it wouldn't hurt to stay a\Nday or two yeah yeah i guess
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could stay a little longer\Nif that's good with you what
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.85,0:19:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is wrong with me i can't even\Nlook at him what's up nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.15,0:19:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.07,0:19:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.98,0:19:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everything's... good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.03,0:19:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's something\Nwrong, you can tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.19,0:19:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of us have already\Nbeen through so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.15,0:19:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you have to say, it'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.19,0:19:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, why are you\Nlooking away like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.19,0:19:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something on my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.77,0:19:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I say something strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.77,0:19:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's got nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.07,0:19:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just started feeling kind of\Nweird all of a sudden, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.23,0:19:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You feel weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.19,0:19:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.11,0:19:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do look a little red.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.65,0:19:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.21,0:19:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you feel sick at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.61,0:19:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's possible that you're exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.03,0:19:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take your temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.53,0:20:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get some blankets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.09,0:20:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you thirsty?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.55,0:20:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off of me, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.01,0:20:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your niceness is creeping me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.77,0:20:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And give me some space!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.77,0:20:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been all over me since we got back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.35,0:20:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why did you change\Nin front of me next night?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.31,0:20:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it in the hallway!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.77,0:20:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.60,0:20:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,above your head...
