Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just because I'm tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.57,0:20:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the only possible reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.69,0:20:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.61,0:20:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes perfect sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.83,0:20:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just tired, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.25,0:20:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, this is where we say goodbye? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.25,0:20:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been quite the adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.81,0:20:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't\Nwant to come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your call to make, Schwartz.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.73,0:20:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in a whole other world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.25,0:20:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to experience\Nas much of it as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.67,0:20:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I'm sure we'll\Nsee each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.71,0:20:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get that Demon Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.25,0:20:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.43,0:21:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we warriors who have faced death\Nside by side will join forces again
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.99,0:21:03.80,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}Fantasy, and you, and you, holding me!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.99,0:21:03.80,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}Fantasy to kimi to kimi to gyutto
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.69,0:21:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in our final battle and crush our\Ngreat enemy with our combined might.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.83,0:21:04.04,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}(For sure!)
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.83,0:21:04.04,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}zettai da!
Dialogue: 2,0:21:03.58,0:21:05.81,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}This is the set list of a goddess.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:03.58,0:21:05.81,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}kami no setto risuto
Dialogue: 3,0:21:05.41,0:21:08.48,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}Let's open the door to heaven!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:05.41,0:21:08.48,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}rakuen no tobira hirake
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.07,0:21:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds pretty awesome, don't you think?
Dialogue: 3,0:21:07.53,0:21:08.66,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}(Open!)
Dialogue: 4,0:21:07.53,0:21:08.66,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}open!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:08.17,0:21:10.06,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}Is it that way?
Dialogue: 6,0:21:08.17,0:21:10.06,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}acchi ka na
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.91,0:21:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's definitely how it'll go.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:09.50,0:21:10.85,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}No, wait.
Dialogue: 7,0:21:09.50,0:21:10.85,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}chotto chigau
Dialogue: 6,0:21:10.34,0:21:12.98,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}It's gotta be this way!
Dialogue: 8,0:21:10.34,0:21:12.98,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}kitto kocchi da yo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.81,0:21:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful for the\Ntime we've had together.
Dialogue: 7,0:21:12.75,0:21:15.61,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}It's an adventure!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:12.75,0:21:15.61,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}bouken da
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two have taught me\Nmore than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.91,0:21:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I know that I should never\Nlet appearances deceive me.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.47,0:21:19.40,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.47,0:21:19.40,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.95,0:21:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that it feels really good to hold\Nnothing back when you punch someone!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.89,0:21:24.82,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}Fantasy, and yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.89,0:21:24.82,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}Fantasy to Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.75,0:21:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like you're learning\Nthe wrong lessons here?
Dialogue: 2,0:21:24.43,0:21:27.68,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}Fabulous, fabulous. Suddenly you appear before me.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:24.43,0:21:27.68,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}fabulous fabulous totsuzen shutsugen
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.41,0:21:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I must admit I'm a\Nlittle reluctant to part ways.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:27.14,0:21:30.08,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}That's too much of a fantasy.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:27.14,0:21:30.08,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}fantasy ga kajou desu
Dialogue: 3,0:21:29.19,0:21:30.29,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}(That's right!)
Dialogue: 3,0:21:29.19,0:21:30.29,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}sou desu
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kind of assumed you didn't\Ncare one way or the other.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:29.86,0:21:33.09,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}Happiness, happiness. I thought it was the end,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:29.86,0:21:35.34,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}happiness happiness kikiteki toki ni tokimeite shimatta no
Dialogue: 5,0:21:32.57,0:21:35.34,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}but we made it out in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.99,0:21:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do, I still owe him for that\Npunch he mentioned earlier!
Dialogue: 6,0:21:34.90,0:21:37.84,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}My fantasy says "yes"...
Dialogue: 6,0:21:34.90,0:21:37.84,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}kono gensou wa yes
Dialogue: 6,0:21:36.70,0:21:38.42,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}(Fluttering on the dream.)
Dialogue: 6,0:21:36.70,0:21:38.42,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}fuwa to On The Dream
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.57,0:21:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 7,0:21:37.65,0:21:40.59,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}But most likely, it's "no"...
Dialogue: 8,0:21:37.65,0:21:40.59,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}demo kanousei wa no
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.49,0:21:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not!
Dialogue: 7,0:21:39.53,0:21:41.09,EDE - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}(Sparkling in my eyes.)
Dialogue: 8,0:21:39.53,0:21:41.09,EDR - Final,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)}kira to In My Eyes
